{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-07/1061992/block/singleImage/3257758/df/04-03_5.jpg?updatedAt=1793788347\"/><p>長沙灣蘇屋邨百合樓有人企圖自殺。今日（4日）下午1時46分，警方接獲蘇屋邨一名居民報案，指目睹一名男子從百合樓一單位攀出窗外，墮樓跌至平台位置。消防員到場將74歲姓楊男事主由平台救下。事主清醒，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院救治。 據悉楊翁獨居多年，事發時在4樓一個單位爬出窗外墮樓。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，將案件列作「企圖自殺」處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:30.893778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:49:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:20.402166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:32.504083+00:00","content_hash":"48bdcadb2570f0b8fbb1b4ad3660b239695d614839d6d7b5b3f91367f64558c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:30.893778+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}